// check_program()'s own block is full (mid/names/limits/shape/block/more/check.id),
// so its last action calls here instead of chk_dead() directly.
//
// The decomposition warnings (docs/PROJECT.md, "decomposition warnings") run
// last: they read the whole parsed program, same as the checks above, but
// report on stderr and never call note_failure, so a violation here never
// changes what check_failed() answers. The last one, check_imp_dup, is the
// exception: two functions that differ only in an imported value are an error
// (checks/impdup/).
check_program_tail() {
  chk_dead();
  check_program_tail2();
} return void;
given lz_empty ():() then calls chk_dead:() then calls check_program_tail2:()
given lz_o ():() then calls chk_dead:() then calls check_program_tail2:()

check_program_tail2() {
  check_genname();
  check_fwd();
  check_imp_dup();
} return void;
given lz_empty ():() then calls check_genname:() then calls check_fwd:() then calls check_imp_dup:()
given lz_o ():() then calls check_genname:() then calls check_fwd:() then calls check_imp_dup:()
